<h1>Rank Math SEO Master Implementation Guide</h1>
<p><strong>Institution:</strong> Techno Mission International School, Bhagalpur (TMISB)<br>
<strong>Target Optimization Plugin:</strong> Rank Math SEO for WordPress<br>
<strong>Target Score Requirement:</strong> 75+ to 88+ (Solid Green) across all 14 website pages<br>
<strong>Date of Release:</strong> 2026-10-26</p>

<div class="card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#003C71;">Rank Math 75+ Green Score Formula</h3>
  <p>To guarantee a <strong>Green Rank Math Score (75-88+)</strong> on each page, the team must ensure:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Focus Keyword:</strong> Entered in Rank Math and placed within the first 10% of page content.</li>
    <li><strong>SEO Title:</strong> Starts with or features the Focus Keyword, includes numbers for title readability, and stays under 60 characters.</li>
    <li><strong>Meta Description:</strong> 150-160 characters, contains Focus Keyword, and ends with an action verb.</li>
    <li><strong>Image Alt Text:</strong> At least one primary image on the page contains the Focus Keyword.</li>
    <li><strong>Subheadings:</strong> At least one H2 or H3 heading contains the Focus Keyword.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

